<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglo says Nairn in talks to join group.</title>
<headline>Anglo says Nairn in talks to join group.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corporation of South Africa Ltd said on Tuesday former JCI Ltd managing director Bill Nairn was in dicusssions with Anglo to join the group.</p>
<p>JCI chairman Mzi Khumalo said earlier on Tuesday that Nairn had agreed to stand down as managing director of the mining house with immediate effect.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
